    "stops_inside_a_chain_publish_nothing_after_the_stop": "All 12 distinct stop positions published a prefix of the seeded trajectory ending at or before the stop, with finish_reason=stop and finish_details.reason=stop, on both arms; 11 of them ran real draft cycles (the one exemption stopped at the first generated token, where no chain can exist, and is recorded per row).",
