  "coverage": {
    "covered": "One seeded 40-token free trajectory, a stop at every distinct token of it, a two-token stop sequence, the min_tokens EOS floor at and below the EOS position, and a concurrent neighbour, through /v1/completions on this KV cell.",
    "not_covered": "Multi-choice (n>1) requests on the sampled route and tool/structured responses, which are task 17; the storage-agnostic property of the rule itself is pinned by tests/test_unit_mtp_eos_boundary.py rather than by this gate."
